          "message": {
            "text": "The independent live-Chromium oracle passes 26/26 at DPR 1 and 26/26 at DPR 2 after suppressing unrelated atomic text surfaces. It requires a vector pattern per physical fragment and structured stitched facts; forced physical-fragment restart mutations visibly drift, while viewport-fixed rows correctly bypass the strip.",
            "markdown": "The independent live-Chromium oracle passes 26/26 at DPR 1 and 26/26 at DPR 2 after suppressing unrelated atomic text surfaces. It requires a vector pattern per physical fragment and structured stitched facts; forced physical-fragment restart mutations visibly drift, while viewport-fixed rows correctly bypass the strip."
          },
